```java
interface Logger { void log(String msg); }

abstract class LoggerService {
    protected abstract Logger createLogger(); // factory method
    public void run(String msg) { createLogger().log(msg); } // template method
}

class ConsoleLoggerService extends LoggerService {
    protected Logger createLogger() { return new ConsoleLogger(); }
}
class FileLoggerService extends LoggerService {
    protected Logger createLogger() { return new FileLogger(); }
}
// Add CloudLoggerService -> new class only. No existing code changes. OCP satisfied.
```

*Simple Factory grows by editing; Factory Method grows by extending.*

